   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 625 of the laws of 1961 relating to the Cleveland Hill\nHose Company ;.lbs;6 Benevolent Association, in relation to its purpose and\nthe use of foreign fire insurance premium taxes",
    "basePrintNo": "S6470",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6470-2021",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §§1, 3 & 7, Chap 625 of 1961",
    "lawSection": "Firefighters",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S6470\n\nSPONSOR: KENNEDY\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend chapter 625 of the laws of 1961 relating to the Cleve-\nland Hill Hose Company #6 Benevolent Association, in relation to its\npurpose and the use of foreign fire insurance premium taxes\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nThis legislation would amend chapter 635 of the laws of 1963 to allow\nthe Cleveland Hill Fire Department No. 6 Firefighter's Benevolent Asso-\nciation to use the foreign fire insurance premium taxes for the purpose\nof enhancing morale by providing social and recreational activities for\nits volunteer members, who are indigent, disabled or injured in the\nperformance of their duties, and their families, and to also promote the\nvolunteer fire service within the territory protected by the Cleveland\nHill Fire Department. This bill also changes the name of the benevolent\nassociation to the \"Cleveland Hill Fire Department No. 6 Firefighter's\nBenevolent Association\".\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 amends sections 1 to change the name of the Association to the\nCleveland Hill Fire Department No. 6 Firefighter's Benevolent Associ-\nation, section 3 to amend the purposes of the Cleveland Hill Benevolent\nAssociation, and section 7 to update references to the Insurance Law.\n\nSection 2 is the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis bill has been introduced at the request of the Cleveland Hill\nBenevolent Association and the Cleveland Hill Fire Department. In order\nto enhance the goals of the Association, it is necessary to amend chap-\nter 635 of the Laws of 1963 to take out language that limits the use of\nthe foreign fire insurance premium taxes received by the Association.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nThis is a new bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS FOR STATE AND LOCAL GOVERNMENTS:\n\nNone.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately; provided however that the amend-\nments to section 7 of chapter 635 of the Laws of 1963 relating to incor-\nporating the Cleveland Hill Fire Department No. 6 Firefighter's Benevo-\nlent Association made by section one of this act shall apply to taxes\ndue on premiums received on and after January 1,\n",
